      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Every node that moves has a Timing heading, open on both of these. The Perlin runs Free: its Speed is how fast \u2014 0 stands it still, a negative runs it backwards. The Cosine Gradient is in Loop mode, its Time cabled from the Master Gear, so its colors turn exactly once every four seconds and stay on the beat. Click Free | Loop on the Timing heading to switch a node between the two."
        }
      },
      "width": 380.0
    },
